OL,3,ADisruption at Port of Dover due to
OL,4,A'stop the boats' protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been major disruption at the
OL,7,FPort of Dover due to a large group of
OL,8,Fmasked men holding a demonstration.
OL,10,FHundreds of protesters, dressed in
OL,11,Fblack and wearing face coverings,
OL,12,Fblocked roads and were heard chanting
OL,13,F"stop the boats".
OL,15,FTraffic was stopped from going in and
OL,16,Fout of the port, with the government
OL,17,Fsaying it condemned "the behaviour in
OL,18,FDover and the travel disruption it has
OL,19,Fcaused".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
