OL,3,ADisruption at Port of Dover due to
OL,4,A'stop the boats' protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police, which made no arrests,
OL,7,Fdescribed it as a "spontaneous"
OL,8,Fprotest. Officers moved the crowd from
OL,9,Fthe port to Dover Priory railway
OL,10,Fstation at about 11:30 BST and the
OL,11,Fforce said "all involved had dispersed
OL,12,Fby 12:00".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
