OL,3,AUS envoys arrive in Moscow ahead of
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of US President Donald Trump's top
OL,7,Fenvoys have arrived in Moscow ahead of
OL,8,Fa weekend of talks aimed at
OL,9,Faccelerating efforts to end the war in
OL,10,FUkraine.
OL,12,FSteve Witkoff and Jared Kushner will
OL,13,Fhold talks in the Russian capital
OL,14,Fbefore travelling to Kyiv on Sunday for
OL,15,Fdiscussions with Ukraine.
OL,17,FRussia's President Vladimir Putin
OL,18,Fordered a halt to strikes on Kyiv for
OL,19,Fthree days due to the US visit, state
OL,20,Fmedia reported, citing the Kremlin.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
